BLK,BlackRock,Financials,2018,blackrock.com/corporate/about-us,1,about page,primary page,20180325204257,https://web.archive.org/web/20180325204257id_/https://www.blackrock.com/corporate/about-us,ok,,224,"Global capabilities
BlackRock has world-class capabilities designed for our clients’ greatest needs, with a comprehensive range of products and services across asset classes, geographies and investment strategies. We have expertise in every region around the world, with 135 investment teams in 30 countries sharing their best thinking in order to seek better returns.
Who we serve
Our clients come from every corner of the globe. They are governments, companies, foundations, and millions of individuals saving for retirement, their children's educations and a better life.
Our singular focus
We're passionate about our work and intensely focused on performing at the highest levels. To get there, we strive to out-think and out-work competitors and find the best balance of risk and return across all investment styles on behalf of our clients.
Responsibility
As a fiduciary for our clients and as public company, our focus is long-term sustainability. We aim to be a responsible corporate citizen and to take into account environmental, social and governance issues that have real and quantifiable financial impacts over the long-term for our firm and the firms in which we invest. Long-term responsibility and sustainability are integrated into our business model and shareholder value creation framework and in the way we conduct our business, serve our clients and give back to the communities in which we and our clients live and work."
BLK,BlackRock,Financials,2019,blackrock.com/corporate/about-us,1,about page,primary page,20190322142311,https://web.archive.org/web/20190322142311id_/https://www.blackrock.com/corporate/about-us,ok,,584,"this possible
A strong purpose helps drive growth. Larry Fink, our founder and CEO, explains in his letter to CEOs how profit and purpose are inextricable from each other.
Read more
By encouraging companies to engage shareholders, our Investment Stewardship team thinks beyond proxy voting to strengthen relationships and deliver long-term value. We advocate for companies to have purpose in order to protect your financial well-being.
See how
Since our founding, we’ve prioritized risk management to better protect our clients. From bringing alpha and index strategies under one roof, to making our proprietary technology available to our competitors, we continue to drive change to help investors achieve their goals. technology to think beyond what’s possible.
We’ve been using Aladdin, our end-to-end investment platform, to provide ourselves and institutional money managers with better risk management for decades. More recently, we’ve brought Aladdin, the foundation of BlackRock, closer to individual investors through Aladdin Wealth.
Discover more
From offering the next generation of investors an opportunity to micro-invest through Acorns, to opening access to alternative investments through iCapital, we’re lowering the barriers to investing with our strategic technology partnerships.
Learn more
Through artificial intelligence and associated disciplines, the BlackRock Lab for Artificial Intelligence seeks to accelerate innovation and technology to improve outcomes and drive progress in the world of investing. investment solutions for every need.
Our broad range of iShares ETFs provide an efficient way to gain exposure to global markets and a full spectrum of asset classes, making investing accessible for more and more people.
Visit iShares
Target Date Funds make investing for retirement easy by removing the complexity and managing your risk as your retirement date nears.
