UNH,UnitedHealth Group,Healthcare,2021,unitedhealthgroup.com/about.html,1,about page,primary page,20210524040010,https://web.archive.org/web/20210524040010id_/https://www.unitedhealthgroup.com/about.html,ok,,209,"Who We Are
We are individuals and teams around the world working to change the face of health care.
Our Mission & Values
Our People & Culture
At UnitedHealth Group, we celebrate our people, ideas and experiences — creating a culture where all team members are appreciated, valued and able to contribute to their full potential.

Our Leaders

Meet the people who are guiding us on our journey to lead the development of the next-generation health system.
Our Businesses
Our Two Complementary Businesses Are Driven To Transform Health Care, One Person, One Health System, At A Time.
Together, UnitedHealthcare and Optum are applying distinctive competencies in insights, technology and clinical excellence to reimagine health care on behalf of those we serve.
Health Equity
We Are On A Journey to Deliver Equitable Health Care For All.
For more than two decades UnitedHealth Group has led efforts to identify, address and monitor health disparities, and collaborate with community organizations and national partners dedicated to health and wellness. We are using our organizational assets, capabilities and market footprint to further health equity.
Corporate Governance
Sound Corporate Governance Principles Help Ensure We Perform With Integrity.
The people of UnitedHealth Group are committed to sound corporate governance principles in everything we do, every day."
