ABBV,AbbVie,Healthcare,2020,abbvie.com/our-company.html,1,about page,primary page,20200215034513,https://web.archive.org/web/20200215034513id_/https://www.abbvie.com/our-company.html,ok,,61,"At AbbVie, we see a future full of possibility, where health is in reach and patient lives are improved. See our employees, our science and our hope for tomorrow.
