TMO,Thermo Fisher Scientific,Healthcare,2016,corporate.thermofisher.com,1,about page,primary page,20160101234341,https://web.archive.org/web/20160101234341id_/http://corporate.thermofisher.com/,ok,,72,"Our Mission in Action
