We promised that 2015 would be a breakthrough year for the Ford Motor Company, and it was. We delivered record profits. Perhaps even more importantly, we fundamentally began to expand our business model to position Ford to deliver long-term growth and value creation in a rapidly changing world.
Contributing to a better world always has been a core value at Ford, and our commitment to sustainability is a key part of our company DNA. Ultimately, our vision is to make people’s lives better by changing the way the world moves, just as Henry Ford did more than a century ago.
As our company grows, the Ford Fund is growing along with it to better serve the communities around the world where we do business. Learn more about the great work Ford, its employees and dealers are doing to help create a better world."
