F,Ford Motor,Consumer Discretionary,2019,corporate.ford.com/company.html,1,about page,primary page,20190331012553,https://web.archive.org/web/20190331012553id_/https://corporate.ford.com/company.html,ok,,285,"Ford Motor Company: Company Information | Ford.com
Our belief:
Freedom of movement drives human progress.
Our aspiration:
To become the world’s most trusted company, designing smart vehicles for a smart world.
Winning Portfolio
We are committed to providing the products our customers want in the markets where we know we can win.
Propulsion Choices
We are committed to producing clean-running cars - without sacrificing the power, style, and performance customers expect.
Autonomous Technology
Our strategy is to build a viable AV business by designing products centered around the needs of humans.
Mobility Experiences
Our goal is to create a set of mobility experiences that win trust, protect data, and address problems of congested cities.
Our history
Our focus on the freedom of movement helped create the middle class with the $5 wage, revolutionized manufacturing with the moving assembly line and got the whole world moving with the first vehicles built for everyone.
About Ford's history
Our leadership
“I believe the purpose of a company is to make people’s lives better. That is how we became great in the past and it is how we will become even greater in the future.”
William Clay Ford Jr.
Executive Chairman, Ford Motor Company
“Breakthrough technologies are transforming nearly every aspect of the vehicles we build and how people use them, demanding a rethink of how we design transportation systems.”
Jim Hackett
President and Chief Executive Officer
More Corporate Governance
Our global operations
Today, Ford Motor Company touches the lives of people in every corner of the globe, not just by making and selling the most technologically advanced, reliable and fun-to-drive vehicles in the world, but by leading the way in manufacturing and business innovation.
Discover where we are"
