History
Our history dates to 1875 through our many predecessor-in-interest companies, including Conoco Inc. and Phillips Petroleum Company (PPCo). These two companies had successful businesses before merging in 2002 to form ConocoPhillips. In 2012, ConocoPhillips separated into two stand-alone publicly traded companies, one of which is Phillips 66. Our company comprises a number of heritage, joint venture and acquired brands.
